1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:04,300
The experiments we've run so far

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,560
prove that the D-mails are being sent to the past.

3
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:12,020
But I couldn't change the outcome of my match with Feyris-tan!

4
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:14,360
That's a problem with you, not with the D-mail.

5
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,440
There are problems with the system,

6
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:18,280
including the issue with Rukako,

7
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:21,400
but if we work on it, we can turn it into a real time machine...

8
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:21,400
Time machine?

9
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,070
You were listening to us?

10
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:27,080
Feyris just brought your order!

11
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,750
Do you want any gum syrup or milk?

12
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:30,250
I refuse!

13
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:32,920
And thus, you can have my everything!

14
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,920
There it is!

15
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:38,090
Secret Move: Stir While Gazing Into Their Eyes!

16
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:41,090
I'm so jealous, Okarin. Explode.

17
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:42,630
Kyouma, what do you mean by a time machine?

18
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:44,140
Do you think you can seduce me

19
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:45,890
into giving up classified information?

20
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:48,810
I won't ask Kyouma.

21
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:49,890
Daru-nyan!

22
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,440
You think Daru would betray me?

23
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:53,020
We built a machine that sends texts to the past!

24
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,400
And by "we," I mean mostly me!

25
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,440
That was entirely too fast!

26
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:58,150
Messages to the past?

27
00:01:13,310 --> 00:01:18,980
